 "<div style=\"text-align:center\"><b style=\"font-size:28px;color:#4338ca\">Títulos III a X</b><br><span style=\"font-size:22px;color:#6b4a3a\">Poderes, territorio y reforma (arts. 66 a 169)</span></div>": "<div style=\"text-align:center\"><b style=\"font-size:28px;color:#4338ca\">Titles III to X</b><br><span style=\"font-size:22px;color:#6b4a3a\">Powers, territory and reform (arts. 66 to 169)</span></div>",
